248
00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.120
Mina teen ka endale lasso,
Lasso tegemine on käkitegu, tuleb,

249
00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.700
oih, näed,
tuleb teha köie otsa silmus,

250
00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.759
