kinni. Mul on ilus,

251
00:17:43.859 --> 00:17:46.670
mul on silmus olema, see täpselt.

252
00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:50.640
Silmus silmus tuleb visata hobusele
ümber kaela.

253
00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.610
Ja siis silmus jookseb kinni,
me saame hobuse kätte

254
00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.340
